WEBVTT

00:02:58.783 --> 00:03:01.349
and she turns red with rage
when she realizes

00:03:01.373 --> 00:03:03.695
that those immigrants from downstairs

00:03:03.719 --> 00:03:07.704
have somehow gotten
their hands on her pizza.

00:03:07.728 --> 00:03:09.260
Everyone's upset.

00:03:09.284 --> 00:03:13.101
But the pizza is delicious.

00:03:13.125 --> 00:03:19.062
It doesn't hit me until years
later just how little we had.

00:03:19.086 --> 00:03:21.376
On our 10 year anniversary
of being in the U.S.,

00:03:21.400 --> 00:03:23.484
we decided to celebrate
by reserving a room

00:03:23.508 --> 00:03:26.366
at the hotel that we first stayed
in when we got to the U.S.

00:03:26.390 --> 00:03:28.785
The man at the front desk
laughs, and he says,

00:03:28.809 --> 00:03:31.667
"You can't reserve a room here.
This is a homeless shelter."